<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref,watch} from 'vue';import {Clock3,ArrowRight} from 'lucide-vue-next';import {useAppStore,defaults} from '../store';import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';
const app=useAppStore();const settings=ref({...app.data?.settings??defaults});const saving=ref(false);const plan=computed(()=>app.data?.plan);watch(()=>app.data?.settings,s=>{if(s)settings.value={...s};});async function save(){saving.value=true;try{await app.save(settings.value);ElMessage.success('目标已保存，计划已重新计算');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(String(e));}finally{saving.value=false;}}
</script>
<template><section class="welcome"><div><span class="eyebrow accent">TODAY'S PRACTICE</span><h2>训练要有重点，也要有节奏。</h2><p>建议来自目标差距、近期表现和训练覆盖，每项都有理由。</p></div><div class="plan-total"><Clock3 :size="24"/><strong>{{plan?.total_minutes??settings.daily_minutes}}</strong><span>分钟 / 今日计划</span></div></section><section class="panel"><h3>你的训练偏好</h3><div class="preferences"><label>每天计划时长<el-input-number v-model="settings.daily_minutes" :min="5" :max="240" :step="5"/></label><label>主攻大项<el-select v-model="settings.focus" clearable placeholder="均衡训练"><el-option v-for="c in app.data?.benchmark?.categories??[]" :key="c.name" :value="c.name" :label="c.name"/></el-select></label><label>目标等级<el-select v-model="settings.target_rank" placeholder="选择目标"><el-option v-for="r in app.data?.benchmark?.config.ranks??[]" :key="r" :label="`${r} Complete`" :value="r"/></el-select></label></div><div class="toolbar"><el-checkbox v-model="settings.prioritize_weak">优先补短板</el-checkbox><el-checkbox v-model="settings.maintain_strength">保留强项训练</el-checkbox><el-button type="primary" :loading="saving" :disabled="app.preview" class="push-right" @click="save">更新训练计划</el-button></div></section><div v-if="plan?.items.length" class="plan-grid"><section v-for="(item,i) in plan.items" :key="item.category" class="panel plan-item"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="eyebrow">BLOCK {{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><strong class="accent">{{item.minutes}} <small>分钟</small></strong></div><h3>{{item.category}}</h3><p class="body-text">{{item.reason}}</p><ul><li v-for="s in item.scenarios" :key="s">{{s}}</li></ul><small class="muted">从你的已配置场景库选择，建议分短组练习。</small></section></div><section v-else class="panel empty"><h3>先添加训练基准</h3><p>需要真实场景库才能推荐今天练什么。导入 Benchmark JSON 后，会自动生成可解释的时间分配。</p><el-button @click="app.page='settings'">配置 Benchmark <ArrowRight :size="15"/></el-button></section><section class="panel"><h3>计划依据</h3><p v-for="note in plan?.notes" :key="note" class="muted">{{note}}</p><p class="muted small">每个已配置大类保留基础权重；补短板 +1、主攻项 +1.5、缺记录 +0.6、超过7天未练 +0.4。按权重分配时长，取整后补足总分钟。数据覆盖不足时先建立基线。</p></section></template>
